 {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Need+Passive Infinitive and Need+Verb+ing"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Need+passive infinitive</span> and <span class=\"strong\">need+verb+ing</span> are two structures you use to talk about fixing problems. You use these structures to imply that you don't know who will fix the problem, or that the person fixing the problem is not the focus of the sentence."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"   Verb \u201cneed\u201d\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" To be\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Participle of Main Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" needs\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to be\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" washed.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Your shirt\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" will need\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to be\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" dry cleaned.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Entirely new floors\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" need\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to be\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" put in.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": " It <span class=\"strong\">needs to be washed</span> right away!"}, {"type": "example", "content": " It <span class=\"strong\">will need to be dry cleaned</span>. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "These floors <span class=\"strong\">need waxing and polishing</span>. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Entirely new floors <span class=\"strong\">need to be put in</span> at my place. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "These windows <span class=\"strong\">need some serious washing</span>. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Paralanguage"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "We use <span class=\"italic\">\u201cparalanguage\u201d</span> to react to a situation. Paralanguage shows how we feel."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Oops - shows error<br/>Wow - shows amazement<br/>Yuck - shows disgust<br/> Ouch - shows pain"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Oops! Sorry Peter."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Ouch! That's hot coffee!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Wow! These are nice hardwood floors."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Yuck! These windows need some serious washing. "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to neglect"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to pay no or little attention or to something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: These walls look like they have been neglected. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le01ob02aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about household problems."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "oak"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a large tree"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Are they pine or oak?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le01ob02aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hardwood "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the hard, strong wood or timber of various broad-leaved trees"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: These are nice hardwood floors."}, {"typ